4. Always use '=' followed by a single expression when defining function bodies in Alloy 6; using curly braces for function bodies is only valid for predicates and facts, not functions.
5. Always use curly braces { } for set and relational comprehensions in Alloy; square brackets [ ] are only for function or predicate invocation.

